  "description": "These large 3 bedroom houses come with their own gardens fitted with artificial grass and 2 car parking spaces. They are spacious, purpose built homes with an abundance of transport options and seaside activities all within walking distance.\r\n\r\nThe homes benefit from an A2 energy rating through zone controlled heating and high efficiency air to water heat pump systems which control all heating and hot water requirements whilst keeping utility costs low.\r\n\r\nInternally, the large kitchens are finished with Quartz work tops and include built in appliances including integrated Neff fridge freezer, dishwasher, Oven, microwave, induction hob and Zanussi combo washer / dryer. \r\n\r\nAs well, there is dedicated utility room for all your storage needs and the kitchen provides a large dining areas for all occasions. The ground floor is completed by a separate spacious warm sitting room and  a downstairs bathroom. \r\n\r\nUpstairs the bedrooms are large and light filled with plenty of storage. The principal bedroom comes with an ensuite equipped with large shower and heated towel rails whilst the main bathroom is finished with stylish contemporary sanitary ware.\r\n\r\n\r\n** Please note there are multiple property types available in this development.\r\nThe rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types.\r\nRents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type. Not all the available properties and rents listed here; please use those available at viewings.\r\n\r\n**Please note the internal photos may not be of the actual property but are representative of the standard of finish**",
